00:20:21,053 --> 00:20:24,180
Are you saying your mom and my mom...

275
00:20:24,181 --> 00:20:25,557
- Wait, what? - What?

276
00:20:25,558 --> 00:20:26,641
- They what? - Them?

277
00:20:26,642 --> 00:20:28,601
- We almost did. - No, that's not it.

278
00:20:28,602 --> 00:20:30,603
- We didn't do anything. We weren't even close. - Yes.

279
00:20:30,604 --> 00:20:31,855
- I get why you'd... - Exactly.

280
00:20:31,856 --> 00:20:33,691
Wait. Stop interrupting her.

281
00:20:33,733 --> 00:20:35,651
Min Seo, what exactly did you see?

282
00:20:35,693 --> 00:20:36,985
What did you do in front of her?

283
00:20:36,986 --> 00:20:39,112
- What about you? A video? - Ye Ji, it's not what you think.

284
00:20:39,113 --> 00:20:41,991
- You strongly denied it when I asked. - It's a misunderstanding.

285
00:20:42,032 --> 00:20:44,534
After acting so innocent and judging me,

286
00:20:44,535 --> 00:20:45,578
