319
00:22:24,927 --> 00:22:27,470
You sleep with this jerk once, and now you're taking his side?

320
00:22:27,471 --> 00:22:30,390
- What are you saying? - Did you call me a jerk? You son of a gun!

321
00:22:30,391 --> 00:22:31,391
- Jeez. - You little...

322
00:22:31,392 --> 00:22:33,644
- You darn punk. - Bring it on!

323
00:22:36,647 --> 00:22:37,648
