407
00:26:17,284 --> 00:26:19,077
Jeez...

408
00:26:19,078 --> 00:26:20,203
Goodness.

409
00:26:20,204 --> 00:26:22,246
Darn it...

410
00:26:22,247 --> 00:26:23,415
Darn...

411
00:26:27,127 --> 00:26:29,587
I've been a fool to put up with you for so long!

412
00:26:29,588 --> 00:26:31,172
Darn!

413
