478
00:30:18,150 --> 00:30:19,151
What the heck?

479
00:30:19,693 --> 00:30:22,320
- Why is he wearing that? - Who's this punk?

480
00:30:22,321 --> 00:30:23,612
What...

481
00:30:23,613 --> 00:30:24,948
You little...

482
00:30:29,244 --> 00:30:31,454
- Wait, that phone. - That's the phone...

483
