532
00:32:38,832 --> 00:32:41,334
- a big misunderstanding. - A misunderstanding?

533
00:32:41,918 --> 00:32:44,920
You hit the private detective that woman hired to kill me...

534
00:32:44,921 --> 00:32:47,506
- What? - and ran.

535
00:32:47,507 --> 00:32:49,133
