536
00:32:49,134 --> 00:32:50,677
Hold on.

537
00:32:53,138 --> 00:32:55,431
- A private detective? - Did you hire...

538
00:32:55,432 --> 00:32:57,183
a private detective to kill Attorney Choi?

539
00:32:57,184 --> 00:33:00,811
No, that's not true. He said he was only going to have a conversation!

540
00:33:00,812 --> 00:33:02,981
Cut the crap, you wench.

541
00:33:03,523 --> 00:33:05,024
Who kidnaps a guy for a conversation...

542
00:33:05,025 --> 00:33:07,109
and talks about slicing him up or boiling him in soup?

543
00:33:07,110 --> 00:33:09,361
It's a miracle he got hit by a car, you venomous snake.

544
00:33:09,362 --> 00:33:10,530
Wait!

545
00:33:14,784 --> 00:33:15,952
Let me get this straight.

546
00:33:17,162 --> 00:33:20,789
The reason that man was there that day...

547
00:33:20,790 --> 00:33:22,416
- What man? - It's someone you don't know.

548
00:33:22,417 --> 00:33:25,336
So that accident happened that night because...

549
00:33:25,337 --> 00:33:26,338
What accident?

550
00:33:28,215 --> 00:33:31,675
And you just sat back, playing innocent this whole time?

551
00:33:31,676 --> 00:33:33,260
Leaving us to clean up your mess?

552
00:33:33,261 --> 00:33:35,262
No, I had no idea it'd turn out like this.

553
00:33:35,263 --> 00:33:37,723
I didn't even want to hire that agency.

554
00:33:37,724 --> 00:33:40,142
The one who set me up with that agency...

555
00:33:40,143 --> 00:33:41,977
and pushed me to hire them was your husband!

556
00:33:41,978 --> 00:33:43,979
- Ahn Soo Jung! - What? Lim Jae Hong?

557
00:33:43,980 --> 00:33:45,564
Both of you, shut it!

558
00:33:45,565 --> 00:33:47,441
Quiet.

559
00:33:47,442 --> 00:33:49,401
All of you just shut your mouths and stay still.

560
00:33:49,402 --> 00:33:50,778
That's enough.

561
00:33:50,779 --> 00:33:53,572
Ms. Park, listen to me carefully.

562
00:33:53,573 --> 00:33:55,574
If you hand over that phone,

563
00:33:55,575 --> 00:34:00,705
I can turn a blind eye to your hit-and-run and contract killing, okay?

564
00:34:01,164 --> 00:34:02,165
Hand it over.

565
00:34:04,000 --> 00:34:05,001
Come on.

566
00:34:06,169 --> 00:34:07,379
Hey, clown.

567
00:34:08,171 --> 00:34:09,811
Do you want to go to jail with your wife?

568
00:34:10,549 --> 00:34:11,966
All I need is that phone.

569
00:34:11,967 --> 00:34:13,342
- What, you punk? - You little...

570
00:34:13,343 --> 00:34:14,469
Wait, stop.

571
00:34:15,303 --> 00:34:17,681
Let me get this straight.

572
00:34:18,223 --> 00:34:19,723
Ahn Soo Jung, you hired...

573
00:34:19,724 --> 00:34:22,309
a private detective to kill Attorney Choi,

574
00:34:22,310 --> 00:34:23,978
and this couple ran over and killed him.

575
00:34:23,979 --> 00:34:25,813
Did I get that right?

576
00:34:25,814 --> 00:34:27,649
I wasn't trying to kill him!

577
00:34:28,608 --> 00:34:29,609
Look.

578
00:34:30,235 --> 00:34:31,735
Did you...

579
00:34:31,736 --> 00:34:34,072
actually see us hit him?

580
00:34:36,116 --> 00:34:37,117
What?

581
00:34:37,993 --> 00:34:40,120
Do you think I'm bluffing?

582
00:34:41,079 --> 00:34:42,997
I saw the two of you...

583
00:34:42,998 --> 00:34:45,666
hit that guy, shake like a leaf,

584
00:34:45,667 --> 00:34:48,295
and then just bolt.

585
00:34:48,753 --> 00:34:51,255
Don't try to deny it.

586
00:34:51,256 --> 00:34:52,465
Just hand it over now.

587
00:34:54,843 --> 00:34:57,137
Are you sure you'll keep your mouth shut...

588
00:34:59,472 --> 00:35:01,141
if I give you the phone?

589
00:35:03,852 --> 00:35:06,396
Looks like we can't be at the sauna after 10pm, either.

590
00:35:07,480 --> 00:35:10,025
Why are people so strict with minors?

591
00:35:10,942 --> 00:35:12,027
Tell me about it.

592
00:35:12,861 --> 00:35:15,321
Adults should bring consent forms from their kids too...

593
00:35:15,322 --> 00:35:16,740
to crack down on adultery.

594
00:35:20,035 --> 00:35:21,327
Hey.

595
00:35:21,328 --> 00:35:24,289
Guess what they told me while having an affair themselves.

596
00:35:25,123 --> 00:35:29,085
They asked me how we could possibly know what real love is at our age.

597
00:35:29,544 --> 00:35:31,421
They said you'd stab me in the back.

598
00:35:32,297 --> 00:35:35,174
After acting like the perfect, cool couple...

599
00:35:35,175 --> 00:35:36,593
Unbelievable, right?

600
00:35:44,309 --> 00:35:45,310
Do you think...

601
00:35:47,020 --> 00:35:49,648
you can ever look your parents in the eye again?

602
00:36:02,118 --> 00:36:03,328
What about us?

603
00:36:05,413 --> 00:36:07,499
Are we good?

604
00:37:10,228 --> 00:37:13,605
We'll check it out, so please head back inside.

605
00:37:13,606 --> 00:37:16,692
No, don't just check. We need you to stop them.

606
00:37:16,693 --> 00:37:19,027
- Stop them. - But it's pretty quiet.

607
00:37:19,028 --> 00:37:21,780
Of course, it's quiet now.

608
00:37:21,781 --> 00:37:23,532
You should've arrived sooner.

609
00:37:23,533 --> 00:37:26,076
Up until a minute ago, they were beating each other up.

610
00:37:26,077 --> 00:37:27,454
Understood.

611
00:37:36,087 --> 00:37:37,713
We'll let you know. Head back inside.

612
00:37:37,714 --> 00:37:38,715
- Text me. - Okay.

613
00:37:39,215 --> 00:37:40,717
How exactly am I...

614
00:37:41,634 --> 00:37:43,303
supposed to trust you?

615
00:37:46,556 --> 00:37:47,932
If you don't trust me,

616
00:37:48,433 --> 00:37:50,185
you'll have to go to prison.

617
00:37:50,935 --> 00:37:52,312
No way.

618
00:37:52,729 --> 00:37:54,980
I'm absolutely not letting this slide.

619
00:37:54,981 --> 00:37:56,523
If I turn a blind eye to this,

620
00:37:56,524 --> 00:37:59,610
I'll become an accomplice to a contract killing and a hit-and-run!

621
00:37:59,611 --> 00:38:01,446
Joo Bo Sung, seriously!

622
00:38:03,198 --> 00:38:05,700
This is the police. We need your cooperation for a moment.

623
00:38:06,451 --> 00:38:08,827
- The police? - Why are the cops here?

624
00:38:08,828 --> 00:38:11,498
Perfect. I'll report everything to them.

625
00:38:13,166 --> 00:38:15,375
- Wait. - Mr. Joo. Can we talk this out a little more?

626
00:38:15,376 --> 00:38:17,169
All I need is the phone.

627
00:38:17,170 --> 00:38:18,629
- I'll give it to you. - What?

628
00:38:18,630 --> 00:38:20,839
Are you saying you'll overlook the fact...

629
00:38:20,840 --> 00:38:22,883
that Ahn Soo Jung ordered a hit on you?

630
00:38:22,884 --> 00:38:24,301
Wake up! We have a trial to win!

631
00:38:24,302 --> 00:38:26,303
- Please stay quiet for a second! - Quiet down.

632
00:38:26,304 --> 00:38:28,464
There's a lot going on here that you don't know about.

633
00:38:38,233 --> 00:38:40,360
Take your hands off me, you criminal!

634
00:38:54,791 --> 00:38:56,375
- Oh, my! - Goodness!

635
00:38:56,376 --> 00:38:57,696
- Attorney Choi. - What happened?

636
00:38:58,878 --> 00:39:00,004
Attorney Choi...

637
00:39:02,257 --> 00:39:03,258
Are you okay?

638
00:39:03,800 --> 00:39:04,801
Hey.

639
00:39:05,218 --> 00:39:07,595
- Are you all right? - Oh, no.

640
00:39:10,181 --> 00:39:11,598
Give me the phone.

641
00:39:11,599 --> 00:39:13,350
- The phone... - Where is it?

642
00:39:13,351 --> 00:39:15,143
Where is the phone?

643
00:39:15,144 --> 00:39:17,145
The phone...

644
00:39:17,146 --> 00:39:19,106
- Give me the phone. - What...

645
00:39:19,107 --> 00:39:20,108
Good heavens!

646
00:39:20,567 --> 00:39:21,568
What's wrong?

647
00:39:21,943 --> 00:39:24,153
- What... - Attorney Choi?

648
00:39:24,696 --> 00:39:25,905
What's wrong with him?

649
00:39:27,031 --> 00:39:28,074
What do we do?

650
00:39:29,576 --> 00:39:30,577
Are you okay?

651
00:39:34,873 --> 00:39:37,000
Your vacation home is amazing.

652
00:39:37,584 --> 00:39:39,585
The view here is stunning.

653
00:39:39,586 --> 00:39:40,587
I know, right?

654
00:39:41,421 --> 00:39:43,673
But not all of this is our land.

655
00:39:44,299 --> 00:39:47,176
The house is probably mortgaged too.

656
00:39:49,846 --> 00:39:53,516
Hey, why is the ground sticking out over there?

657
00:39:54,058 --> 00:39:55,059
What?

658
00:39:55,852 --> 00:39:56,978
You're right.

659
00:39:57,520 --> 00:39:58,980
It wasn't like this before.

660
00:40:00,356 --> 00:40:01,357
What's this?

661
00:40:02,150 --> 00:40:03,359
How strange.

662
00:40:06,195 --> 00:40:08,030
Do you smell that?

663
00:40:08,031 --> 00:40:09,115
A smell?

664
00:40:10,116 --> 00:40:12,826
You're right. It didn't smell like this before.

665
00:40:12,827 --> 00:40:14,954
- Did a rat die or something? - I know, right?

666
00:40:15,747 --> 00:40:17,874
It smells like something's rotting.

667
00:40:31,930 --> 00:40:33,388
Have a seat.

668
00:40:33,389 --> 00:40:34,640
Do you want something to drink?

669
00:40:34,641 --> 00:40:36,517
What? Yes, thanks.

670
00:41:57,015 --> 00:41:58,349
Want a beer?

671
00:42:05,064 --> 00:42:07,358
Ye Ji, about that night...

672
00:42:07,984 --> 00:42:09,985
You know, the night of the accident.

673
00:42:09,986 --> 00:42:13,072
Your parents said they handled it,

674
00:42:13,781 --> 00:42:17,535
but do you know what they did to the dead man?

675
00:42:18,536 --> 00:42:19,704
Well...

676
00:42:28,046 --> 00:42:29,756
We've met before, haven't we?

677
00:42:36,888 --> 00:42:38,472
I'm not really sure.

678
00:42:38,473 --> 00:42:40,391
Come on, back at the demolition site.

679
00:42:41,059 --> 00:42:42,477
Did you find the cat?

680
00:42:47,190 --> 00:42:48,608
What brings you here?

681
00:42:49,192 --> 00:42:51,986
I just had some business in the area.

682
00:42:55,907 --> 00:42:58,075
This is our vacation home,

683
00:42:58,076 --> 00:43:00,912
- so how did you... - Yes, I know.

684
00:43:01,788 --> 00:43:03,247
I'll be leaving shortly.

685
00:43:04,040 --> 00:43:06,667
I wasn't trying to eavesdrop,

686
00:43:08,669 --> 00:43:10,004
but who did you say died?
